502: ## Resource Layer Tests (REST Assured)
503: 
504: ```java
505: @QuarkusTest
506: @DisplayName("DocumentResource API Tests")
507: class DocumentResourceTest {
508: 
509:   @InjectMock
510:   DocumentService documentService;
511: 
512:   @Nested
